Yang Dong 1/3: Slightly long oval face, narrow forehead, fine straight nose, thin brows, calm almond eyes and small composed mouth.
Yang Dong 2/3: Straight glossy black hair below the shoulders with bangs swept from her left to right; restrained observant expression.
Yang Dong 3/3: Light sky-blue blouse beneath grey cardigan, dark trousers and small brown leather document bag; clean black ink and flat cel shadows.
